      "description": "This kernel executes 642880 fused and 1771840 non-fused FP32 instructions. By converting pairs of non-fused instructions to their fused (https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/floating-point/#cuda-and-floating-point), higher-throughput equivalent, the achieved FP32 performance could be increased by up to 37% (relative to its current performance). Check the Source page to identify where this kernel executes FP32 instructions.",
